<title>BULGARIA: WEATHER FORECAST - BULGARIA - JUNE 24 - SUNNY, WARM.</title>
<headline>WEATHER FORECAST - BULGARIA - JUNE 24 - SUNNY, WARM.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mostly sunny across the country, with rain expected later in the day, state radio said.</p>
<p>Maximum temperatures are expected between 25 and 30 degrees, temperature in Sofia is seen at about 25 degrees. -- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-91188</p>
